{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id222410756"}, "name":{"label":"Megz1599"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-09T20:39:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"13119519570"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic scheduling app!"}, "content":{"label":"This app has been so useful for me! I have raging ADHD but I work better with a schedule, so I would always write one on a piece of paper, and forget about it after a couple of days. Plus, if anything changed from the schedule it would all get thrown out for the day, because it was too difficult to fit new things around it. This app solves all the problems I have with this! \n\nI can set up my whole week’s schedule, to be recurring week in week out, and the app will always pop up to remind me to move to the next task, go eat dinner, start winding down to bed, etc. I spent so long looking for an app like this, and I’m so glad I’ve found one! Thank you to the developers for making it accessible for people on shoestring budgets too, it’s really appreciated.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
